@startuml semver-lefthook-lifecycle
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif

actor "Developer / Agent" as Dev
participant "Git CLI" as Git
participant "Lefthook / Hooks\n(commit-msg)" as HookPre
participant "SemVer Engine\n(tools/semver.py)" as Engine
participant "Lefthook / Hooks\n(post-commit)" as HookPost
participant "Git Object DB\n& Tags" as GitDB
participant "Cascade Runtime\n(CLI & Menu Bar)" as Cascade

== 1. Commit Creation & Conventional Format Validation ==
Dev -> Git : git commit -m "feat: add new feature"
Git -> HookPre : commit-msg (msg file)
HookPre -> Engine : check-msg <file>
alt Invalid Message (e.g. "update code")
  Engine --> HookPre : exit 1 (Invalid Conventional Format)
  HookPre --> Git : Abort commit
  Git --> Dev : Error: must follow <type>: <description>
else Valid Message (e.g. "feat: ...")
  Engine --> HookPre : exit 0 (Valid Conventional Commit)
  HookPre --> Git : Proceed with commit
end

== 2. Commit Object Creation ==
Git -> GitDB : Record commit object (HEAD)

== 3. Post-Commit Automatic SemVer Bumping ==
Git -> HookPost : post-commit
HookPost -> Engine : post-commit
Engine -> GitDB : Read HEAD commit subject & previous tag (e.g. v0.17.0)

note over Engine
  Strict Sequential Bumping Rules (from 0.0.0):
  - breaking (! or BREAKING CHANGE) -> major + 1, minor=0, patch=0
  - feat -> minor + 1, patch=0 (e.g. 0.17.0 -> 0.18.0)
  - fix/chore/refactor/docs -> patch + 1 (e.g. 0.17.0 -> 0.17.1)
end note

Engine -> GitDB : git tag -a v0.18.0 HEAD -m "v0.18.0"
Engine -> Engine : Update VERSION file ("0.18.0")
Engine --> HookPost : [Lefthook] Version bumped: v0.17.0 -> v0.18.0 on HEAD
HookPost --> Git : Complete

== 4. Zero-Node.js Build & Runtime Resolution ==
Dev -> Git : make build
note over Cascade
  Makefile reads SemVer version:
  - Injects -DCASCADE_VERSION="0.18.0" into cascade CLI
  - Stamps CFBundleShortVersionString in Info.plist
  Zero Node.js runtime required (Pure Go + Python/ObjC)
end note
Dev -> Cascade : cascade --version
Cascade --> Dev : "Cascade 0.18.0"
@enduml
